    {
      "uid": "zhcn:680508fa4039d2751afe5796",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想要尽一切努力，\n让自己在正式演出的时候\n能发挥帅气的演技……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "adfa1cea4a28bef41322ad43983c18738c2df3535670960ab635309509482705",
